## Interpretation boundary

- Solid arrows represent workflow dependencies.
- Dashed arrows represent hypotheses or later validation fixtures.
- The seven causes are operator candidates, not assumed primitive ontology.
- The source corpus supplies analytical vocabulary; it does not automatically define the complete rule-space.